Modifications in this fork
--------------------------
Arena Code modifies the upstream work. The material changes are:

- Renamed product and CLI surface to Arena Code / arena.
- Custom TUI: home layout, session view, council route, taskbar.
- Themes: arena-soft, arena-code, arena-emerald, arena-noir, nova-dark.
- Free-model provider routing (9router, Kilo Code) and a rotating
  free-model selector plugin.
- Localized build/version string (OPENCODE_VERSION).

Copyright in the above modifications is held by the Arena Code authors.
